      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Do you have SMT disabled as well? I was aware that if you disable that, you gain some performance, but was not aware of singling out VRChat to a single CCX would further increase that.\nWould using something like Process Lasso (https://bitsum.com/) be an effective way to set this up? It is an extra service you have to run in the background, and obviously not a permanent fix.\nI have a Ryzen 3600, which has 3 cores per CCX. Compared to a 3950x, which has 8 cores per CCX, I'm not sure if users on a lower-end Ryzen sku would benefit from this feature request, though I'm also not sure how many threads VRChat takes advantage of in real usage...",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
