      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c9ef183b51f4e0393a812e8|full_name}: Haven't tried disabling SMT yet. Probably worth a try, but that's a systemwide change so it's not one that can be made part of the base VRChat client. I have however tried further restricting the affinity set - going down to 2C/4T (on one CCX) seems to be even better.\nProcess lasso is a good way to do this as a temporary workaround, but if this is this effective it should probably just be baked into the base client.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
