  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-11-21T18:44:08.043Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I've observed significant framerate improvements (~30%) by configuring VRChat's CPU affinity to restrict it to a single CCX on my Ryzen 3950X (and a friend of mine confirmed this works on 5950X as well). It would be handy if VRChat did this configuration automatically - and would likely give a big perf boost to all Ryzen multi-CCX CPU users.",
